48 class Agent(BaseAgent):
49     """Represents an agent in a system.
50 
51     Each agent has a role, a goal, a backstory, and an optional language model (llm).
52     The agent can also have memory, can operate in verbose mode, and can delegate tasks to other agents.
53 
54     Attributes:
55             agent_executor: An instance of the CrewAgentExecutor class.
56             role: The role of the agent.
57             goal: The objective of the agent.
58             backstory: The backstory of the agent.
59             knowledge: The knowledge base of the agent.
60             config: Dict representation of agent configuration.
61             llm: The language model that will run the agent.
62             function_calling_llm: The language model that will handle the tool calling for this agent, it overrides the crew function_calling_llm.
63             max_iter: Maximum number of iterations for an agent to execute a task.
64             max_rpm: Maximum number of requests per minute for the agent execution to be respected.
65             verbose: Whether the agent execution should be in verbose mode.
66             allow_delegation: Whether the agent is allowed to delegate tasks to other agents.
